logs/
# JSONL is ignored by default. NOTE (Phase 12F release hardening):
# the nine FINAL-frozen benchmark v2 artifacts under datasets/v2/ include eight
# *.jsonl files that are intentionally NOT tracked here. They are externally
# materialized and byte-verified against the FINAL manifest
# (datasets/v2/manifests/benchmark-v2-manifest.json) via
# scripts/materialize_v2_frozen_artifacts.py. Their integrity is guaranteed by
# manifest SHA-256, not by git tracking.
#
# Do NOT add a blanket "!datasets/v2/**/*.jsonl" un-ignore rule: the holdout
# split (datasets/v2/cases/holdout.jsonl, datasets/v2/labels/holdout.jsonl) must
# remain a blind, externally-held holdout and must not be exposed for tracking as
# a side effect of release packaging. Materialization is explicit and audited;
# git exposure is not.
*.jsonl
